---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

import ImgComparison from "../../components/ImgComparison.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../../components/SectionHeading.astro";
import DesignArchive from "../../components/DesignArchive.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Nasdaq Data Link Product Page Redesign">
    <section class="hero bg-Charcoal h-screen p-2">
        <div
            class="projectCard w-full flex flex-col gap-4 p-6 bg-FloralWhite rounded-lg"
        >
            <div class="text-lg flex justify-between gap-4 items-center">
                <h1 class="font-semibold">
                    <span>Data Link</span>

                    <br />
                    <span class="font-light">Product Page Redesign</span>
                </h1>
                <span
                    class="h-0.5 bg-Timberwolf w-full flex-[1] self-end translate-y-[-1em]"
                ></span>
            </div>

            <p>
                I redesigned the Nasdaq Data Link product page to simplify
                complex financial dataset offerings. By introducing a
                single-page layout with a dynamic pricing component and clearer
                product details, we improved user trust, boosted self-serve
                checkouts, and reduced support requests.
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>Project type: Marketing & Product UX</li>
                <li>Role: Product Designer</li>
                <li>Platform: Nasdaq Data Link</li>
                <li>
                    Focus: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur, adipisici
                </li>
            </ul>

            <div
                class="w-full pt-4 flex gap-4 border-t border-Charcoal projectNav"
            >
                <a class="fill-Silver hover:fill-UtOrange" href="#"
                    ><svg
                        width="4em"
                        viewBox="0 0 53 14"
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    >
                        <path
                            d="M6.96613 14L0.123156 7.15702L6.96613 0.314048L7.86733 1.19997L2.5518 6.51549H52.9882V7.79855H2.5518L7.86733 13.0988L6.96613 14Z"
                        ></path>
                    </svg>
                </a>

                <a class="fill-current hover:fill-UtOrange" href="#"
                    ><svg
                        width="4em"
                        viewBox="0 0 54 14"
                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    >
                        <path
                            d="M46.7105 14L45.8094 13.0988L51.1249 7.79853H0.688477V6.51547H51.1249L45.8094 1.19995L46.7105 0.314026L53.5535 7.157L46.7105 14Z"
                        ></path>
                    </svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-2 py-8">
        <SectionHeading boldText="Understanding" restText="the Problem" />
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
            <p>
                The original product page was fragmented and hard to navigate.
                Key information like pricing and documentation was buried across
                tabs, leading to user frustration, low conversion rates and an
                increase in support tickets.
            </p>

            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                <div class="p-6 border-2 border-Charcoal rounded-lg">
                    <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                        <li>
                            <span class="font-mono font-medium">01<br /></span>
                            Tabs (Data, Documentation, Usage) fragmented the experience.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span class="font-mono font-medium">02<br /></span>
                            Example data didn’t communicate the dataset and to download
                            it required a new window interaction.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span class="font-mono font-medium">03<br /></span>
                            Product descriptions didn’t clearly communicate value.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span class="font-mono font-medium">04<br /></span>
                            Pricing info was buried below the fold.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <img
                        src="/assets/dl-product-page/place_holder.png"
                        alt=""
                    />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-2 py-8">
        <SectionHeading boldText="Exploring" restText="Design Directions" />
        <div>
            <p>
                I audited the existing experience, analyzed support tickets and
                mapped the user journey to surface friction points. Interviews
                with users and internal teams revealed blockers around pricing
                clarity, content visibility and trust. These insights shaped
                early concepts and aligned stakeholders around key priorities.
            </p>

            <div>
                <figure>
                    <figcaption>
                        Some sketches I created during my exploration phase
                    </figcaption>

                    <div class="swiper sketches">
                        <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                <img
                                    src="/assets/dl-product-page/place_holder.png"
                                    alt="Placeholder"
                                />
                            </div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                <img
                                    src="/assets/dl-product-page/place_holder.png"
                                    alt="Placeholder"
                                />
                            </div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                <img
                                    src="/assets/dl-product-page/place_holder.png"
                                    alt="Placeholder"
                                />
                            </div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                <img
                                    src="/assets/dl-product-page/place_holder.png"
                                    alt="Placeholder"
                                />
                            </div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                <img
                                    src="/assets/dl-product-page/place_holder.png"
                                    alt="Placeholder"
                                />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </figure>
            </div>
            <figure>
                <figcaption>
                    <strong>Wireframes</strong> that helped everyone stay on the
                    same page
                </figcaption>

                <img
                    src="/assets/dl-product-page/place_holder.png"
                    alt="Placeholder"
                />
                <img
                    src="/assets/dl-product-page/place_holder.png"
                    alt="Placeholder"
                />
            </figure>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-2 py-8">
        <SectionHeading boldText="Crafting" restText="the Solution" />
        <div>
            <p>
                I audited the existing experience, analyzed support tickets and
                mapped the user journey to surface friction points. Interviews
                with users and internal teams revealed blockers around pricing
                clarity, content visibility and trust. These insights shaped
                early concepts and aligned stakeholders around key priorities.
            </p>
            <figure>
                <figcaption>Before & After</figcaption>
                <ImgComparison
                    firstImgURL="/assets/dl-product-page/dl-product-before.jpg"
                    secondImgURL="/assets/dl-product-page/dl-product-after.jpg"
                />
            </figure>
        </div>
    </section>

    <DesignArchive title="Other projects" />
</BaseLayout>

<script>
    import Swiper from "swiper";
    import "swiper/css";

    new Swiper(".sketches", {});
</script>

